  <diagram name="Página-1" id="qnFhWY5yXzAO1D4Uaaur">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2196" dy="705" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor A as Administrador\n    \n    box rgb(240, 248, 255) Frontend (React Native)\n        participant VS as AdminScreen\n        participant H as useModeration\n        participant MF as ModerationManager\n        participant VO_F as ModerationVO\n    end\n    \n    box rgb(255, 240, 245) Backend (Spring Boot)\n        participant R as ModerationRouter\n        participant C as ModerationController\n        participant SB as ModerationService\n        participant VO_B as ModerationVO\n        participant DB as MySQL\n    end\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;VS: Selecciona estado (ej. Verificado) y escribe motivo\n    VS-&gt;&gt;H: moderateReport(reportId, \&quot;Verificado\&quot;, motivo)\n    H-&gt;&gt;MF: updateStatus(reportId, \&quot;Verificado\&quot;, motivo)\n    MF-&gt;&gt;VO_F: new ModerationVO(reportId, estado, motivo, adminId)\n    VO_F--&gt;&gt;MF: retorna vo\n    MF-&gt;&gt;R: PUT /api/v1/reports/status (vo JSON)\n    \n    R-&gt;&gt;C: updateStatus(req, res)\n    C-&gt;&gt;VO_B: new ModerationVO(req.body)\n    VO_B--&gt;&gt;C: retorna vo\n    C-&gt;&gt;SB: processModeration(vo)\n    \n    SB-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE reportes SET estado = vo.estado WHERE id = vo.reportId\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SB: Update OK\n    SB-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO bitacora (admin_id, accion, motivo)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SB: Insert OK\n    \n    SB--&gt;&gt;C: Moderation Success\n    C--&gt;&gt;R: return ResponseEntity.ok(success)\n    R--&gt;&gt;MF: HTTP 200 OK\n    MF--&gt;&gt;H: return success\n    H--&gt;&gt;VS: update UI State\n    VS--&gt;&gt;A: Muestra \&quot;Reporte moderado y registrado en bitácora\&quot;\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="3wDl7sSjf7suQr4Hno5r-1">
